toric creatures, they must survive while uncovering the island's secrets through scattered explorer notes left by previous inhabitants. As survivors progress through increasingly difficult boss encounters, they begin to piece together the truth about the Ark and the technology sustaining it. The deeper story, revealed through expansion packs, follows survivors as they travel from the island to an underground alien world, a corrupted future Earth, and eventually aboard a massive colony ship traveling through deep space in search of a new home for humanity.", "summary": "Ark: Survival Evolved is an open-world action-adventure survival game where players awaken stranded on a mysterious island populated by dinosaurs, prehistoric creatures, and mythical beasts. Gameplay revolves around gathering resources, crafting tools and structures, and taming creatures that can be ridden or used for combat and transportation. The game supports both single-player and multiplayer modes, with multiplayer servers allowing players to form tribes and compete or cooperate. Several expansion packs add new maps and storylines, and the game spawned an animated series, a remaster in Unreal Engine 5 titled Ark: Survival Ascended, and a planned sequel.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ark-survival-evolved", "videos": [{"id": 22932, "name": "Gamescom 2015 Trailer", "video_id": "hh2VkuYQQHE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh2VkuYQQHE", "title": "ARK: Survival Evolved - Gamescom 2015 Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hh2VkuYQQHE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 22931, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5-I92iPYOWs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5-I92iPYOWs", "title": "ARK: Survival Evolved on Nintendo Switch, Coming November 30, 2018!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5-I92iPYOWs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 22930, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "j4NvBtcMfZM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j4NvBtcMfZM", "title": "ARK: Survival Evolved on Nintendo Switch, Coming 30 November 2018!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/j4NvBtcMfZM/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 28511, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "2d_b5fRZmlA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2d_b5fRZmlA", "title": "ARK: Summer Bash 2019!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2d_b5fRZmlA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 22933, "name": "Reveal Trailer", "video_id": "kJ8Io-vOejA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kJ8Io-vOejA", "title": "ARK: Survival Evolved - Reveal Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kJ8Io-vOejA/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 5352, "name": "Ark"}]}